  "title": "Simplest way to change the demo mode gif?",
  "body": "Does anyone have an idea what is the easiest way to change the demo mode gif? I found the images file in the github but I'm not sure what I can change in the install script to make it push another gif to the device or if thats silly and maybe there is a simpler solution. thanks!",
